            "exact_text": "This function assumes that the channel contains multiple distinct cell types with different marker\ngenes. If you try and run it on a channel with very homogenous cells (e.g. a cell line, flow-sorted\ncells), you will likely get a warning, an error, and/or an extremely high contamination estimate.\nIn such circumstances your best option is usually to manually set the contamination to something\nreasonable.",
